 Documentation/crypto/libcrypto.rst            |  1 +
 include/crypto/aes-ecb.h                      | 49 ++++++++++++++++
 lib/crypto/Kconfig                            |  6 ++
 lib/crypto/aes.c                              | 56 +++++++++++++++++++
 lib/crypto/tests/Kconfig                      |  1 +
 6 files changed, 141 insertions(+)
